---
// AboutPreview.astro - 100% Arvune Dimensions & Animations
---

<section id="about" class="py-28 lg:py-36 bg-white border-b border-brand-border">
  <div class="arvune-container">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Tag + Arvune 52px Button -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-6 reveal">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-red"></span>
          <span>Who We Are</span>
        </div>

        <div>
          <a 
            href="#projects" 
            class="arvune-btn-dark group"
          >
            <span>Discover More</span>
            <span class="arvune-arrow-box-white">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Editorial Headline, Narrative & 3 Stat Cards -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-8">
        <h2 class="reveal delay-1 text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-[56px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[-0.05em] text-[#0D0F0F] leading-[1.08]">
          We Imagine. We Refine.<br />
          We Craft Masterpieces<br />
          Across Los Angeles.
        </h2>

        <p class="reveal delay-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-normal">
          We believe great living spaces begin with how a space makes you feel. At Pacific West Home Builders, we have elevated residential construction across Los Angeles for decades, pairing artisan finishes with structural integrity. From initial blueprint engineering to municipal permits and interior delivery, we take pride in exceeding expectations at every milestone.
        </p>

        <!-- Arvune 3-Stat Cards Row (Staggered Animations) -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-4">
          <div class="reveal delay-1 p-8 lg:p-10 bg-[#F5F4F7] rounded-[12px] space-y-2 border border-black/[0.03] transition-all hover:bg-zinc-200/60 duration-300">
            <div class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-black text-[#0D0F0F] tracking-tight">25+</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-zinc-500">Years of Experience</div>
          </div>

          <div class="reveal delay-2 p-8 lg:p-10 bg-[#F5F4F7] rounded-[12px] space-y-2 border border-black/[0.03] transition-all hover:bg-zinc-200/60 duration-300">
            <div class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-black text-[#0D0F0F] tracking-tight">350+</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-zinc-500">Projects Completed</div>
          </div>

          <div class="reveal delay-3 p-8 lg:p-10 bg-[#F5F4F7] rounded-[12px] space-y-2 border border-black/[0.03] transition-all hover:bg-zinc-200/60 duration-300">
            <div class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-black text-[#0D0F0F] tracking-tight">100%</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-zinc-500">Client Satisfaction Rate</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
